{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The ground looks big and the outfield is not so quick. Australia realized late that they need to bowl well to get wickets - if South Africa manage to contain the top order, this big ground might just prove difficult to chase. Stay tuned...", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T11:07:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "In a 10-over game, you do expect the batsmen to go hammer and tongs. That is exactly what South Africa did. Australia started poorly with the new ball and got hammered, conceding 42 in the Powerplay. They then brought it back a little, thanks to their spinners, with Glenn Maxwell going for just 14 in his 2 overs. The seamers then finished it off nicely towards the end.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T11:05:42+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Well, one would say, that is a handful of a score for South Africa. However, Australia will look at it in this manner - just 10 runs came from the final 2 overs. Will that have an impact on the final outcome? You never know.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T11:04:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "64221", "Commentary": "Another play and a miss to end the innings. A length ball outside off, Phehlukwayo swings hard, only to miss again. 4 runs and 2 wickets from the final 2 overs. AUSTRALIA REQUIRE 109 TO WIN!", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T11:01:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "64221", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, Phehlukwayo goes hard at it but misses.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T11:01:27+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "5,202,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "64221", "Commentary": "A full toss outside off, slapped through covers for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T11:00:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Andile Phehlukwayo walks in  at number 8, replacing Morris.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T11:00:08+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "48816", "Commentary": "OUT! EDGED AND TAKEN! Morris bags a duck and the good passage of play for Australia continues. This is full and outside off, Morris swings but the ball takes the outside edge and goes into the mitts of the keeper. Second in the over for Tye and the first half of the final over belongs to Australia.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "48816", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:59:51+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "48816", "Commentary": "Wide! Too outside off, the batsman lets it be.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:58:51+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,293,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "33963", "Commentary": "A full toss on off, FB can't take full toll of it, he plays it down to long on, only for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:58:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Chris Morris walks in at number 7. He can tonk a few.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:57:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "OUT! Another one bites the dust! A full toss outside off, Miller reaches out to it and hits it uppishly towards sweeper cover. Short there runs in a little and holds onto it. Killer Miller is walking back and Australia fighting back well here.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "5313", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:57:09+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "4,154,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "33963", "Commentary": "A full ball outside off, squeezed over point for a couple. Excellent one from Coulter-Nile. Just 6 runs and a wicket from it. Finally a good one for the Aussies.", "Summary": {"Score": "104/4", "Over": "9", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "33963", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "2", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "5313", "Runs": "11", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10090", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "2"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:55:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "Huge appeal for LBW, turned down! Wonder why that was not given out. On a length, around middle, David looked to pull but missed. He was hit on the pads and the ball went towards short third man. A quick leg bye taken.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:54:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "A slower ball, around middle and off, Miller looks to pull but misses. Is hit on the pads.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:54:06+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "4,144,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "Very full and outside off, Miller squeezes it through cover-point for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:53:29+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Farhaan Behardien walks in next with 10 balls left.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:52:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "59736", "Commentary": "OUT! Klaasen holes out! Nathan bowls the slower ball on middle, Klaasen tries to clear long on but does not get the elevation he wanted. Maxwell in the deep runs ahead and takes a nice catch. A good start to the penultimate over, a run and a wicket.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "59736", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:52:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,125,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "Slower ball to begin with, Miller tries to guide it past the short third man fielder but hits it straight to him. A run taken.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:50:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Nathan Coulter-Nile is back on.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:50:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "4,142,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "59736", "Commentary": "FOUR! Excellent shot again. The ball is not that bad though. Full and wide outside off, Klaasen reaches out to drive but gets a bit of an outside edge, over the man at backward point, with the ball racing to the fence. 14 from the over, 28 from the last 2!", "Summary": {"Score": "98/3", "Over": "8", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59736", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "12", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "5313", "Runs": "8", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64274", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:49:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,221,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, David drives this uppishly through the covers but Finch has a man stationed to perfection at the extra cover fence. Just a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:49:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "2,89,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "FOUR! Off the top edge now! A short ball, around middle, Miller looks to pull but the bounce gets big on him. Takes the top edge and goes over the keeper to the fence behind!", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:48:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "5,204,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "Excellent fielding by Stoinis! This is caressed through covers. Stoinis in the deep runs to his right, dives and saves a couple for his side.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:47:42+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,296,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "59736", "Commentary": "A low full toss on middle, Klaasen hits it down to long on for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:47:22+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,343,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "Just a single from the Free Hit! It is short and on the helmet. It is pulled towards deep mid-wicket for a run. Good change in length by Tye. Miller must have expected a slower ball.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:47:02+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "nb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64274", "Batsman": "5313", "Commentary": "A poor start that! It must have surely slipped out of his hands. A high full toss outside off, Miller lets it be. He must have been surprised. No ball signaled by the umpire and it is a Free Hit.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:46:42+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "David Miller is the new man in. Also, Andrew Tye is into the attack.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:44:51+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "OUT! Excellent catch by Maxwell! Great presence of mind by Glenn Maxwell. A short ball, around off, du Plessis pulls it over mid-wicket but does not quite have the timing. For a second, it seems like it will clear the ropes. However, Glenn Maxwell stationed at the mid-wicket fence, watches the ball till the last moment, then leaps, takes the catch, realizes that he is going over, parries it up in the air, comes out and then gobbles it!", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "28891", "Summary": {"Score": "84/3", "Over": "7", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "28891", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "27", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "4", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "59736", "Runs": "7", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57308", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "23", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:44:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,299,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "FOUR! Just over! A high full toss on middle, Faf comes down the track and looks to go over the top but mistimes it. The fielder at mid on leaps but it goes over him and races to the boundary!", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:43:08+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,339,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "Comes down the track and whips it through mid-wicket for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:42:42+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "That has been smashed but straight to the fielder! Short and around off, Faf slaps it hard but straight to covers.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:42:07+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "59736", "Commentary": "Excellent running and it also a wide! Klaasen shapes up to play the paddle. Stanlake tries to bowl the slower one but bowls it down the leg side. The batsmen run through for a bye.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:41:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,108,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "59736", "Commentary": "FOUR! Clever, very clever. He makes room and gets a short ball. Knows that third man is up in the ring. He just upper cuts it over that fielder and a boundary results.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:40:19+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,332,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "59736", "Commentary": "Angles this one onto the pads, Klaasen flicks it through mid-wicket. They run the first one hard, go for the second and complete it. Maxwell there did fire it towards the bowler but Stanlake fails to collect it.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:39:25+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Billy Stanlake is back on.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:38:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,101,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "FOUR BYES? No, runs! Initially it felt like a missed stumping opportunity. But the umpire reckons that there was a piece of wood involved. Another full toss outside off, du Plessis comes down the track and has a wild heave but misses. The ball beats everyone, even the keeper and races to the fence behind. Runs given.", "Summary": {"Score": "70/2", "Over": "6", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "28891", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "21", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "59736", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10085", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:38:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "A full toss outside off, du Plessis has a wild heave but misses.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:37:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "Comes down the track and hits it back to the bowler.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:37:25+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,342,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "FOUR! A wicket has fallen but Faf will continue looking for runs. He brings out the sweep shot and nails it through mid-wicket for a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:36:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,326,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "59736", "Commentary": "A low full toss on middle, Klaasen hits it down to long on for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:36:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Heinrich Klaasen walks in at number 4, replacing de Kock.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:35:52+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "OUT! STUMPED! Maxwell's very good spell continues! He sees de Kock make room and also step out. Follows him and also bowls it quicker. De Kock tries to force it through the off side but that shot was never on. He misses and Carey behind the stumps, takes the bails off with ease. Quinton who started to struggle after the Powerplay departs and Australia need to keep taking wickets if they are to stem the run flow.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "28035", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:35:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "4,141,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66573", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "Another piece of luck! Full and outside off, Faf comes down the track and looks to go inside out but the ball turns away from him and takes the outside edge. It goes in the air but goes over the men running back from backward point and short third man! Two runs taken.", "Summary": {"Score": "61/1", "Over": "5", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "28891", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "13", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "28035", "Runs": "22", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "2"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66573", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:34:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,216,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66573", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "FOUR! That has been smoked through the off side! Short and outside off, du Plessis goes back and punches it through the covers for a boundary!", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:33:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "6,246,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66573", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "IN THE AIR AND SAFE! Tossed up outside off stump, du Plessis dances down the track and lofts it over covers but does not get the distance. It lands in no man's land. The batsmen pick up a couple.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:33:07+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66573", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "NOT OUT! Impact is outside off! Australia's only review goes down the drain. A poor one to be honest, the impact always looked outside off. This is tossed up on off, de Kock plants his front foot outside off and goes for the sweep. He misses to get hit on the pads. The ball rolls towards the off side and the batsmen take a leg bye. The bowler in the meantime is appealing but the umpire shakes his head. Finch reviews and replays show the impact is outside off.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:32:44+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "LBW review! Australia reckon that Quinton de Kock has been adjudged LBW. The umpire has given it not out and Finch wants another look...", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:31:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,231,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66573", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "Faf makes room now and he slaps it through covers only for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:30:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": "4,153,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66573", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Starts off with a short ball on the stumps. de Kock makes room and then cuts it through point for three runs. The outfield is quite big here, we might see quite a few threes. 50 up for South Africa and it has come up in quick time.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:29:44+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "D'Arcy Short comes on to bowl now. Big gamble.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:28:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Now attempts the reverse sweep but gets hit on the pads. The ball deflects towards mid-wicket. A leg bye taken.", "Summary": {"Score": "48/1", "Over": "4", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "28035", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "19", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "28891", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10085", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:28:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Comes down the track but Maxwell fires it in. De Kock looks to cut but is cramped for room. Gets a bottom edge.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:28:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,341,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "Tossed up on middle stump, Du Plessis comes forward and flicks it towards mid-wicket. They take a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:27:46+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "4,149,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "A couple! Faf makes room and tries to go over covers. He ends up slicing it over point and takes a brace.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:27:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,345,1", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Good running! This is fired on the stumps, giving the batsman no room to play with. Quinton tries to defend but gets it off the inner half beside the pitch for a quick run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:26:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,344,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10085", "Batsman": "28891", "Commentary": "Flatter and on the pads, it is worked around the corner on the leg side for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:25:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Glenn Maxwell to bowl now.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:25:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Outside off, played towards point. De Kock wants a single but is sent back. 42/1 IN THE POWERPLAY! Real power-hitting.", "Summary": {"Score": "42/1", "Over": "3", "Runs": "18", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "28035", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "18", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "28891", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "10090", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "14", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:24:55+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Faf du Plessis is the new man in.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:23:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "OUT! That ends the cameo from Hendricks! That is how every innings will be described tonight. A short ball, much better than the previous ones, coming in at around face height. Hendricks looks to pull again but this time, is cramped for room. Gets a top edge which does not quite clear the fence. Simple catch for Ben McDermott at the fence. Much-needed wicket for Australia.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "4356", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:23:44+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,336,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "FOUR! Bowls again short outside off stump, Hendricks again pulls it towards mid-wicket for a beautiful boundary.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:22:22+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,333,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "SIX! 14 from the first three balls! South Africa are off to a flier! Short ball and on the body, too easy for Reeza. He swivels and pulls it over the mid-wicket fence for a huge one.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:21:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,339,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "FOUR! Consecutive boundaries! The last over of the Powerplay has started well. Pressure on Nathan now. Slightly short and on off, it sits up to be hit. RH pulls it over mid-wicket and the ball races away.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:21:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "10090", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "FOUR LEG BYES! Poor start by him! Down the leg side, Hendricks fails to flick it, the ball brushes the pads and races to the fine leg fence.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:20:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Nathan Coulter-Nile is into the attack.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:20:09+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "6,233,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "SIX! Beautiful shot. Bowls full outside off stump, de Kock lofts it over mid off for a biggie.", "Summary": {"Score": "24/0", "Over": "2", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "28035", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "18", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "2"}, {"Batsman": "4356", "Runs": "5", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57308", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:19:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Change of bats for de Kock.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:18:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Full outside off stump, de Kock hits it towards mid off.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:18:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Pitched around leg, Quinton has a massive heave but misses. Is hit high on the pads and the Aussies appeal but in vain.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:17:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, a massive swing from de Kock but no connection.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:17:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,155,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "Bowls wide outside off stump, Hendricks cuts it towards point. The batsmen take a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:16:52+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "WIDE! Bowls down the leg side, Hendricks lets it go.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:16:20+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,343,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57308", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Full and around middle, de Kocik swings hard but the ball goes off the inner half through square leg. A single taken.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:15:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Billy Stanlake to bowl from the other end.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:14:46+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57041", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "Outside off, a swing and a miss. 15 RUNS from the opening over!", "Summary": {"Score": "15/0", "Over": "1", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4356", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "28035", "Runs": "11", "Balls": "4", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "1"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57041", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:14:05+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,206,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57041", "Batsman": "4356", "Commentary": "FOUR! Hendricks gets going too! On a length outside off, Reeza punches this between cover and mid off and gets a boundary!", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:13:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": "4,159,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57041", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Full and outside off, punched through point for three runs.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:12:42+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,18,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57041", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "SIX! Down the leg side, de Kock flicks it wayyy over square leg! This is not a small ground, mind you.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:12:22+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57041", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Excellent fielding. Full and outside off, Quinton drives it through the covers where Ben McDermott dives to his right and makes a brilliant stop.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:11:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "2,53,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57041", "Batsman": "28035", "Commentary": "Down the leg side, flicked through square leg for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:11:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Out come the players to the middle. Quinton de Kock and Reeza Hendricks will start off the innings for South Africa. Jason Behrendorff to bowl first up, to de Kock. Here we go!", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:09:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "TOSS - Right then. Birthday boy Aaron Finch has won the toss and AUSTRALIA WILL CHASE. Totally decision taken based on the conditions, nothing else.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:09:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "WEATHER - It seems to have cleared up, though it is hard to tell in the night sky whether it is overcast or not. There is a massive thunderstorm just around the corner, so hopefully, this T10 match gets completed by then.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:08:10+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Sadly, the name itself takes the excitement of the contest away. A 10-over shootout literally means bashing, means cricket will go to the cleaners. Hopefully, we get some sort of an entertainment.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:07:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "HURRAY! Let's have it again. HURRAY! Wow. What a phenomenal effort from the groundstaff. Till 30 minutes ago, we were ready to pack our bags and go home. Did not feel like we would have a game. But here we are. The folks taking care of their ground have strut their stuff and lo, behold! We have a game. Albeit, a 10-over contest.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-17T10:05:24+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 86, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:15:11 AM"}}}